[{"code":"view_not_compiled","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":13,"col":18},"end":{"line":13,"col":29}},"title":"VIEW NOT COMPILED","message":"`Tea.sandbox` is used here as a value rather than called with its record, so the\nprogram it makes, and that program's `view`, are known only when the page runs.\n\nThe markup lowering `inline` compiles each program where its constructor is\ncalled (`docs/design/browser-direct.md` §11.1), and has no renderer to hand a\n`view` it did not compile. Call `Tea.sandbox` with the program's record here, or\nbuild for `--platform=browser-tea`, which renders any `view`."},{"code":"view_not_compiled","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":13,"col":31},"end":{"line":13,"col":42}},"title":"VIEW NOT COMPILED","message":"`Tea.element` is used here as a value rather than called with its record, so the\nprogram it makes, and that program's `view`, are known only when the page runs.\n\nThe markup lowering `inline` compiles each program where its constructor is\ncalled (`docs/design/browser-direct.md` §11.1), and has no renderer to hand a\n`view` it did not compile. Call `Tea.element` with the program's record here, or\nbuild for `--platform=browser-tea`, which renders any `view`."},{"code":"view_not_compiled","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":13,"col":44},"end":{"line":13,"col":56}},"title":"VIEW NOT COMPILED","message":"`Tea.document` is used here as a value rather than called with its record, so\nthe program it makes, and that program's `view`, are known only when the page\nruns.\n\nThe markup lowering `inline` compiles each program where its constructor is\ncalled (`docs/design/browser-direct.md` §11.1), and has no renderer to hand a\n`view` it did not compile. Call `Tea.document` with the program's record here,\nor build for `--platform=browser-tea`, which renders any `view`."},{"code":"view_not_compiled","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":13,"col":58},"end":{"line":13,"col":73}},"title":"VIEW NOT COMPILED","message":"`Tea.application` is used here as a value rather than called with its record, so\nthe program it makes, and that program's `view`, are known only when the page\nruns.\n\nThe markup lowering `inline` compiles each program where its constructor is\ncalled (`docs/design/browser-direct.md` §11.1), and has no renderer to hand a\n`view` it did not compile. Call `Tea.application` with the program's record\nhere, or build for `--platform=browser-tea`, which renders any `view`."}]
